  "cards": [
    {
      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "Request path",
      "items": [
        "Envoy Gateway on localhost:8088: / is the UI, /api both API pods (prefix stripped), /grafana, /prometheus, /alertmanager",
        "Auth checks the HS256 JWT and the account, then the user's rate limit and the day's token budget (Redis)",
        "Readiness is /readyz (database answers); metrics live on :9100, which no route reaches"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "violet",
      "title": "Memory through the queue",
      "items": [
        "Summaries, idle threads, Remember this and the remember tool become one SQS FIFO message each, grouped by user",
        "The worker acks a push only after it's written; a failure comes back in 5 min, the 6th lands in the DLQ",
        "If the queue is down, the API runs the push itself and counts it"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "rose",
      "title": "Safety",
      "items": [
        "PII is redacted in the message, tool results, replies and the stream",
        "A web search with sensitive terms or an order number waits for approval and resumes from its checkpoint",
        "Secrets are files in /run/secrets from a generated Secret; the pods mount no service account token"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "emerald",
      "title": "Rollouts and jobs",
      "items": [
        "migrate runs Alembic and the LangGraph setup before the API and worker roll out",
        "preStop waits for open streams before uvicorn gets SIGTERM; PDB keeps one API pod up",
        "reranker-model fills the shared model volume once; retention prunes checkpoints nightly; Postgres archives WAL to MinIO and takes a base backup at 02:00"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "amber",
      "title": "Reliability",
      "items": [
        "Model calls retry once, then fall back to gpt-4.1 (FALLBACK_MODEL)",
        "Circuit breakers per model, embeddings and web search, shared in Redis: 5 outages in 60 s open one for 30 s",
        "Embeddings, web search and memory recall degrade instead of failing the turn; web results are cached in Redis for 10 min",
        "One run per thread across pods: a lease on the thread's row, a second run gets 409"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "orange",
      "title": "Observability and evals",
      "items": [
        "ServiceMonitors scrape every API pod and the worker; 13 PrometheusRule alerts; the Chatbot dashboard in Grafana",
        "Runs are traced to Langfuse (Docker Compose), reached through a Service with a manual EndpointSlice",
        "make eval judges the same agent and scores each trace; CI rejects a stale or worse report"
      ]
    }
  ]
